The property includes a beach and swimming area[ on] the Pond, where one can[ pull] up and store canoes, kayaks, sailboats, (Sunfish, Laser are available). A canoe is available for exploring the pond and paddling to the barrier beach. To further enhance your stay, sailboats and kayaks can be rented from Winds Up[ on] the Beach Road in Vineyard Haven.
